OL,3,GNEWSATeenager seriously injured after
OL,4,Abeing hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager suffered serious injuries
OL,7,Fafter he was hit by a Mazda car.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FLadywood Road in Kirk Hallam, near
OL,11,FIlkeston, at about 08:00 BST on
OL,12,FThursday, said Derbyshire Police.
OL,14,FThe teenager suffered injuries which
OL,15,Fthe force said were serious but not
OL,16,Flife-threatening. His age has not been
OL,17,Freleased.
OL,19,FNo arrests have been made but police
OL,20,Fsaid the driver, a woman in her 20s,
OL,21,Fstopped at the scene and was assisting
OL,22,Fofficers with their inquiries.
